        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/b2d939/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-27T16:13:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi all, not sure which would best forum for this, but here seems good.</p><p>I was playing the app on my ipad yesterday, here was the game:</p><p>Gloomweaver (Challenge Mode)</p><p>Madame Mittermeir's</p><p>Bunker (Engine of War); Captain Cosmic (Prime Warden); Chrono-Ranger; Expatriette.</p><p>Since I am in challenge mode, I am expecting that I need to just push through, do 90 to Gloomweaver, than another 40, and stay alive in the process.&nbsp; I get Gloomweaver down and...here is where things are hazy, because suddenly, when I expect him to flip, the game declared it a Victory for me and ended.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>I think the card in Madame that makes \"Villain\" \"Hero\" was in play, and there was one relic in play (not sure which one).&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>I wish I could remember exactly what other cards were in play, but any thoughts on what might have happened?&nbsp; &nbsp;It happened so suddenly I was startled, it seemed like a bug, but maybe it wasn't?&nbsp; The only thing I can think of is some kind of discard effect put all three relics in his trash, but a) I'm pretty sure as I said a relic was in play and b) it happened the moment he flipped, not at the start of his turn.</span></p><p>Anyway, any thoughts?&nbsp; If its a bug I should report it, but I don't have enough details really to be helpful, and their could be an obvious cause on the cards themselves that I am missing.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:46.565Z",
