        "raw": "<p>Hi all, not sure which would best forum for this, but here seems good.</p><p>I was playing the app on my ipad yesterday, here was the game:</p><p>Gloomweaver (Challenge Mode)</p><p>Madame Mittermeir&#39;s</p><p>Bunker (Engine of War); Captain Cosmic (Prime Warden); Chrono-Ranger; Expatriette.</p><p>Since I am in challenge mode, I am expecting that I need to just push through, do 90 to Gloomweaver, than another 40, and stay alive in the process.&nbsp; I get Gloomweaver down and...here is where things are hazy, because suddenly, when I expect him to flip, the game declared it a Victory for me and ended.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>I think the card in Madame that makes &quot;Villain&quot; &quot;Hero&quot; was in play, and there was one relic in play (not sure which one).&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">I wish I could remember exactly what other cards were in play, but any thoughts on what might have happened?&nbsp; &nbsp;It happened so suddenly I was startled, it seemed like a bug, but maybe it wasn&#39;t?&nbsp; The only thing I can think of is some kind of discard effect put all three relics in his trash, but a) I&#39;m pretty sure as I said a relic was in play and b) it happened the moment he flipped, not at the start of his turn.</span></p><p>Anyway, any thoughts?&nbsp; If its a bug I should report it, but I don&#39;t have enough details really to be helpful, and their could be an obvious cause on the cards themselves that I am missing.</p>",
